# The pinned Cua Driver release, as shell reads it: scripts/cua-driver.sh
# fetches and verifies these assets for .github/workflows/release.yml.
#
# The source of truth is cua-protocol/src/cua_driver_pin.rs; the
# cua-protocol test `the_pin_file_mirrors_the_rust_table_for_scripts`
# fails whenever this file and the Rust table disagree, so move the pin in
# both places at once.
#
# Lines: `<key> <value>` for the release, `asset <target triple> <asset name> <sha256> <size>` per target.
